Script","id":1,"title":"世界のプログラミング言語(37) 達人に愛され30年周年Vimを支えたVimScript","title_link":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/programinglanguageoftheworld-37/","text":"開発者を中心に幾多のユーザーに愛されてきたテキストエディタのVimが30周年を迎え話題になっています。Vimは1991年にリリースされたテキストエディタですが、今なお現役で多くのユーザーに使われています。そして、その陰にはVimScriptと呼ばれるVimを拡張するスクリプト言語の存在があります。今回はVimを支えるVimScriptにフォーカスしてみます。","image_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/programinglanguageoftheworld-37/index_images/index.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1636331300,"service_name":"TECH+","service_icon":"https://news.mynavi.jp/images/techplus/favicon_techplus.ico","from_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/programinglanguageoftheworld-37/","original_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/programinglanguageoftheworld-37/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9YLC+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"582b957e-0f41-4cfb-ad5d-e97c12794be1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ジェネレーター作って","ts":"1636433995.033400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KnzL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c1cd0f7-3fe0-48f9-b7ac-5323044b7644","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"びぃむりこを見てここって動物多いから(?)たべっこどうぶつの方があってるよな〜と思った","ts":"1636432512.032000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LnPhT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7523738-fca7-4936-86ed-f599e3a2dce9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"指が止まらないってそういう","ts":"1636429153.030300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kpa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"958432e6-e6a4-445d-bb81-4938e6167152","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あれw 赤の色味がずいぶん強いなw","ts":"1636428801.029700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ojlGM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15049291-1257-4b32-98ac-764f24adff71","type":"message","user":"